{"unit_id":"mojiezhenlinana__dsh-scroll-bottom#card-zh","repo":"mojiezhenlinana/dsh-scroll-bottom","commit":"1a0f55dd06fd1f81e79ff25fe6bdae58fb02ef57","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-scroll-bottom 是一个面向 DSH 网页客户端的小型界面插件，在对话输入框上方提供圆形的回到底部按钮。它通过浏览器端模块加载按钮和样式，查找对话滚动容器及输入框位置，并根据滚动距离控制按钮显示。主要功能包括上翻超过阈值时显示按钮、点击后平滑滚动到最新消息、随输入框坐标定位，以及在窗口尺寸或页面内容变化后重新布局。它适合经常查看较长对话历史、希望快速回到最新消息的 DSH 网页用户。插件不声明额外密钥、账号或运行时外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:103-131","lib/client.js:153-165","lib/client.js:188-227"]}
{"unit_id":"mojiezhenlinana__dsh-scroll-bottom#card-en","repo":"mojiezhenlinana/dsh-scroll-bottom","commit":"1a0f55dd06fd1f81e79ff25fe6bdae58fb02ef57","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-scroll-bottom adds a circular button above the composer in DSH web chats. When you scroll up through older messages, it appears and returns the conversation to the latest message on click. Its position follows the composer as the page layout changes.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:103-131","lib/client.js:153-165","lib/client.js:188-227"]}
