{"unit_id":"mojiezhenlinana__dsh-scroll-bottom#feature-1","repo":"mojiezhenlinana/dsh-scroll-bottom","commit":"1a0f55dd06fd1f81e79ff25fe6bdae58fb02ef57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-scroll-bottom 的功能「按需显示返回按钮」：当对话滚动容器距离底部超过 120 像素时显示圆形按钮，接近底部时自动隐藏。按钮由浏览器端模块插入页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:21-23","lib/client.js:188-199"]}
{"unit_id":"mojiezhenlinana__dsh-scroll-bottom#feature-2","repo":"mojiezhenlinana/dsh-scroll-bottom","commit":"1a0f55dd06fd1f81e79ff25fe6bdae58fb02ef57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-scroll-bottom 的功能「平滑回到最新消息」：点击输入框上方的圆形按钮后，插件将对话滚动容器滚到内容末端；不支持平滑滚动时会直接设置滚动位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:119-131","lib/client.js:212-218"]}
{"unit_id":"mojiezhenlinana__dsh-scroll-bottom#feature-3","repo":"mojiezhenlinana/dsh-scroll-bottom","commit":"1a0f55dd06fd1f81e79ff25fe6bdae58fb02ef57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-scroll-bottom 的功能「贴合输入框定位」：按钮根据输入框的实际屏幕坐标放在其上方居中；窗口调整或页面内容变化时重新计算位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:153-165","lib/client.js:202-210","lib/client.js:220-230"]}
{"unit_id":"mojiezhenlinana__dsh-scroll-bottom#feature-4","repo":"mojiezhenlinana/dsh-scroll-bottom","commit":"1a0f55dd06fd1f81e79ff25fe6bdae58fb02ef57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-scroll-bottom 的功能「自动识别对话滚动区」：优先查找宿主标记的对话容器，未找到可滚动容器时再从消息节点的父级向上查找。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:48-69"]}
